        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: New York City, Lower Manhattan\n- Buildings: Central Park Place, World Trade Center, 888 7th Avenue\n- People: Dan Nelson\n- Companies: Emery Roth & Sons\n\nFacts:\n- The original World Trade Center was a complex of seven buildings in Lower Manhattan, New York City, United States, from 1973 to 2001.\n- Central Park Place is a 56-story condominium building in New York City.\n- Emery Roth & Sons designed 888 7th Avenue, which is tied with Central Park Place as the 65th tallest building in New York City.\n- Dan Nelson, born on June 21, 1976, is an American singer-songwriter, guitarist, and bassist from New York City.",
